{"unit_id":"windwhiterain__dsh-subagent-templates#card-zh","repo":"windwhiterain/dsh-subagent-templates","commit":"62f807b2c58e263f45bf7df2780764e8f95fb722","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Subagent Templates（DSH 网页端插件）：通过命名模板将任务委派给独立子会话。它提供委派和模板查询工具，父会话可列出、联系、中断或删除子任务。模板可固定模型路由或从路由池选择，并设定 agent preset、persona 和工具限制。前台调用等待并返回结果，后台调用完成后通知父会话。网页侧边栏可查看、打开子会话，设置页可编辑模板和并发、嵌套上限。适合需要并行拆解任务并持续跟进的 DSH 用户。模板需引用已配置的模型提供方和 preset；路由池模板还需对应服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:604-625"]}
{"unit_id":"windwhiterain__dsh-subagent-templates#card-en","repo":"windwhiterain/dsh-subagent-templates","commit":"62f807b2c58e263f45bf7df2780764e8f95fb722","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Subagent Templates delegates work into named DSH sessions with templates for routes and presets. Parents can list, message, interrupt, or delete children. Calls run in foreground or background, with results reported back. A sidebar shows children; settings edit templates and limits.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:604-625"]}
