{"unit_id":"windwhiterain__dsh-subagent-templates#feature-1","repo":"windwhiterain/dsh-subagent-templates","commit":"62f807b2c58e263f45bf7df2780764e8f95fb722","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Subagent Templates 的功能「模板委派」：父 agent 选择模板、给子任务命名并提供独立提示；模板可固定 provider/model 或按路由池分配，并可应用 preset、persona 和工具限制。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/session-delegate.js:413-425"]}
{"unit_id":"windwhiterain__dsh-subagent-templates#feature-2","repo":"windwhiterain/dsh-subagent-templates","commit":"62f807b2c58e263f45bf7df2780764e8f95fb722","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Subagent Templates 的功能「前台与后台执行」：每次委派可选择等待子会话首轮结果，或立即返回名称并在子会话自然结束时收到通知。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tool.js:294-302"]}
{"unit_id":"windwhiterain__dsh-subagent-templates#feature-3","repo":"windwhiterain/dsh-subagent-templates","commit":"62f807b2c58e263f45bf7df2780764e8f95fb722","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Subagent Templates 的功能「子任务管理」：父会话可列出子任务、按名称发送消息或中断当前工作；删除操作会停止并归档会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tool.js:539-555"]}
{"unit_id":"windwhiterain__dsh-subagent-templates#feature-4","repo":"windwhiterain/dsh-subagent-templates","commit":"62f807b2c58e263f45bf7df2780764e8f95fb722","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Subagent Templates 的功能「网页面板与设置」：侧边栏列出子会话并可打开会话；设置页编辑模板及嵌套深度、同时运行数量上限。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1376-1386"]}
{"unit_id":"windwhiterain__dsh-subagent-templates#caveat-1","repo":"windwhiterain/dsh-subagent-templates","commit":"62f807b2c58e263f45bf7df2780764e8f95fb722","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Subagent Templates 使用 storage domain 保存父子会话映射；若部署未挂载 storage domain form，映射不会持久化，插件会记录提示并继续运行。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/store.js:140-149"]}
